      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Union Pacific Railroad established a depot in Waterloo in 1871, making it a key stop along the Elkhorn‑Platte Valley route.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
